<title>UK: LIFFE cocoa off low, coffee up and steady in PM.</title>
<headline>LIFFE cocoa off low, coffee up and steady in PM.</headline>
<text>
<p>COCOA - July holds 980 support, bounces off day's low of 981. 1,000 March trade. At 1445 GMT, July down 10 at 987.</p>
<p>COFFEE - Holds gains after NY's July makes contract high. July up $39 at $1,657.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Extends losses as NY weakens. Aug off 1.8 at 308.6.</p>
</text>
